      "writtenOn": "2023-05-04T16:31:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I tested this on a pixel 7 with GSI flashed. But this is a good point. Not all AVB props are configured with GSI. \n\nAVB spec says, \"On Android, the boot loader must set the androidboot.verifiedbootstate parameter on the kernel command-line to indicate the boot state.\" Init then exports this kernel cmdline parameter as a property.\n\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/platform/external/avb/+/master/README.md#android-specific-integration\n\nThis prop is explicitly required in AVB spec. Other props, like `ro.boot.vbmeta.digest`, are not though.",
      "parentUuid": "cde07c29_c469186d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 105,
