      "writtenOn": "2023-05-04T08:17:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This means bootloader doesn\u0027t report hash algorithm to keymint right?\n\nThe bootloader reports the following info to init, in kernel cmdline.\n\n  [ro.boot.vbmeta.digest]: \n  [76c277d99b08bcf2f2f7ee2fabb0ef452ad64b0f61be4b8b72ef9c746901ec2c]\n  [ro.boot.vbmeta.hash_alg]: [sha256]\n  [ro.boot.vbmeta.size]: [8896]",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 140,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 141,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "c4665d941133a360da8143a643da97c1b2c96446",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
